WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.602 --> 00:00:04.962
- [Gary] It breaks my heart my 
friends live for Friday night.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:07.972
Monday morning's the worst.

00:00:07.972 --> 00:00:10.601
It's just a huge 
percentage of one's life.

00:00:10.601 --> 00:00:12.723
I can't wrap my head 
around with the internet.

00:00:12.723 --> 00:00:14.664
This is not your 
grandpappy's life.

00:00:14.664 --> 00:00:16.988
We have the internet,
you can make shit happen.

00:00:16.988 --> 00:00:19.693
You can build businesses
or side hustles,

00:00:19.693 --> 00:00:22.764
I just don't understand why 
people relegate into

00:00:22.764 --> 00:00:25.133
losing mentality and 
just thinking they can't.

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:27.222
You can't because you want 
to be on the bowling team

00:00:27.222 --> 00:00:29.598
or softball or play video games,
that's why you can't.

00:00:29.598 --> 00:00:31.302
There's plenty of time,
get shit done.

00:00:31.302 --> 00:00:33.954
The level of complaining 
is unacceptable.

00:00:33.954 --> 00:00:36.682
Look, what if I told you 
this was the last

00:00:36.682 --> 00:00:38.362
Monday morning of your life?

00:00:38.362 --> 00:00:40.122
What if I told you 
you die this week?

00:00:40.122 --> 00:00:42.192
Would you complain 
about your crap job

00:00:42.192 --> 00:00:44.003
or that test you 
don't want to take?

00:00:44.003 --> 00:00:45.013
I doubt it.

00:00:45.013 --> 00:00:47.252
You would go much 
higher level thinking.

00:00:47.252 --> 00:00:48.983
Well, that's really 
what it takes.

00:00:48.983 --> 00:00:52.942
It takes understanding that if 
you're not pumped right now,

00:00:52.942 --> 00:00:55.032
if you're begrudging 
what you're about to do,

00:00:55.032 --> 00:00:56.673
if you're not looking forward,

00:00:56.673 --> 00:00:59.063
please recognize the 
world we're living in.

00:00:59.063 --> 00:01:01.553
We're living in a world where
there's so much more opportunity.

00:01:01.553 --> 00:01:05.424
This internet thing created way 
more opportunity for all of us.

00:01:05.424 --> 00:01:08.144
Way more. I mean, look,
you may not even be alive.

00:01:08.144 --> 00:01:11.503
Your mom and dad coulda 
had sex like three minutes later

00:01:11.503 --> 00:01:13.983
and you wouldn't even exist 
and you're complaining.

00:01:13.983 --> 00:01:15.723
You coulda ended up being a bus,

00:01:15.723 --> 00:01:19.844
a tree. I just don't get the 
mentality of being head down,

00:01:19.844 --> 00:01:21.854
sad on a Monday morning.

00:01:21.854 --> 00:01:23.853
I'm gonna make Monday 
morning my bitch.

00:01:23.853 --> 00:01:25.874
I'm going to make you 
Saturday, Monday morning.

00:01:25.874 --> 00:01:27.435
That's what I want 
to do every morning

00:01:27.435 --> 00:01:29.044
and that's what I want from you.

00:01:29.044 --> 00:01:31.764
Please, take a step back 
and think about how

00:01:31.764 --> 00:01:34.925
awesome it actually is 
and then recognize that

00:01:34.925 --> 00:01:37.935
you can attack the world 
in a totally different way

00:01:37.935 --> 00:01:42.214
'cause you were lucky enough 
to be born during this era.

00:01:42.214 --> 00:01:44.323
(light music)

